      <activity id="50510d3a-fc44-5f28-b2b5-16960006e7cb" activityNameId="f81ffc7c-110d-5e10-8497-b2ba21a0cb77" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Mine, gold and silver</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Mine, gold and silver
This data set includes land use of the considered mines incl. revegetated areas as well as estimates of buildings and machinery of the mine based on the data set non-ferrous metal, mine, surface/underground.;
UUID: cd8fbc60-a370-3063-b37f-27b04c360282
Land use, buildings and machinery of a gold and silver mine
Location: Land use of Papua New Guinea-plant, other inputs based on rough assumptions.
Technology: Assumptions for buildings and machinery based on the data set "non-ferrous metal, mine, surface/underground with 50 years life time.
Time period: Period of public environmental report
Production volume: 11.3 Mill. t ore per year
Sampling: environmental report  for landuse in the year 2000 and one mine  in 2006 
Extrapolations: Buildings and machinery are based on global assumptions. The figures were extrapolated on the basis of the ore production.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_cd8fbc60-a370-3063-b37f-27b04c360282.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
